er and plan-runner; click the new tile once and diff. Read: the new tile swaps the colour of the selected piece; nothing else moved. Act: extend the level-2 plan with one swap click, run it through the retained runner that checks each step against the expected position and stops on the first mismatch. Result: all steps matched, level completed on the final move.\n'
